Revert arm of scripts/demo/d440a-m0-check.sh (#462): the UE keeps its start
position (no sim_route), so it stays camped on gnb-west while CM-IDLE, never
reselects to gnb-east, and the check must fail at ue step 3/7.

  scripts/demo/revert-run.sh --expect "[ue] step 3/7 missing" \
      scripts/demo/reverts/d440a-m0-ue-stays-put.patch -- scripts/demo/d440a-m0-check.sh

